@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #365B7D
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #A8BACB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FC
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #44627F
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F6F9FC
skinparam titleFontSize 21
autonumber
title Загрузка CloudDrive: сначала объект и проверка, затем публикация версии
actor "Клиент" as C
participant "Core API" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nprimary" as DB
participant "RGW / Ceph" as S3
participant "Outbox relay" as R
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Scan worker" as W

C -> API : POST /uploads\nIdempotency-Key, size, expected generation
API -> DB : TX: lock quota, reserve bytes,\ncreate UPLOADING session + idem result
DB --> API : session / immutable object key
API -> S3 : CreateMultipartUpload
S3 --> API : upload_id
API -> DB : persist upload_id; reconciliation if interrupted
API --> C : session + short-lived UploadPart URLs

loop До 4 параллельных частей; размер части 8 МиБ
  C -> S3 : UploadPart(upload_id, part_no, bytes)
  S3 --> C : part ETag
end

C -> API : POST /uploads/{id}/complete\nsame idempotency key on retry
API -> S3 : CompleteMultipartUpload / HEAD
S3 --> API : immutable object exists; actual size
API -> DB : TX: QUARANTINED + scan.requested in outbox
API --> C : 202: проверка выполняется; старая READY ещё доступна

DB -->> R : poll unpublished outbox
R -->> K : publish event_id, owner_id, version_id
K -->> W : scan.requested (duplicates possible)
W -> S3 : GET stream; checksum / ClamAV
S3 --> W : bounded stream

alt CLEAN и expected generation совпадает
  W -> DB : ONE TX: inbox unique(event_id), CAS version,\nREADY + current_version + quota + outbox
  DB --> W : commit (sync standby in another AZ)
  W -->> K : commit offset after DB commit
  C -> API : GET upload status / download ticket
  API -> DB : primary: READY + current ACL
  API --> C : GET URL, TTL 60 s
  C -> S3 : GET / Range GET
  S3 --> C : original bytes
else REJECTED / CONFLICT / scan limit
  W -> DB : terminal status, release reservation once,\nold current version unchanged; GC later
  W -->> K : commit offset after persistent result
end

note over DB,W
  At-least-once delivery + idempotent effect.
  Offset or Kafka producer idempotence alone does not give exactly-once SQL/S3.
end note
note over API,S3
  Only the backend can create/complete multipart.
  UploadPart URLs cannot overwrite the completed scanned object.
  Reconciliation covers a crash between S3 completion and SQL commit.
end note
@enduml
